Rule 5 (axis must be 0 or -1 if the input tensor is 1-dimensional)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= if ndim(v_1) = 1 then v_2 = 0 ∨ v_2 = -1
>>
Rule 7 (Axis constraint for 2-dimensional tensor)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= if ndim(v_1) = 2 then v_2 ≥ -2 ∧ v_2 ≤ 1
>>
Rule 8 (Size of dimension 0 must be at least 1 when unstacking along axis 0)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= if ndim(v_1) ≥ 1 ∧ v_2 = 0 then shape(v_1, 0) ≥ 1
>>
Rule 9 (for the unstacked positive axis, the dimension size must be non-zero)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= if v_2 ≥ 0 ∧ v_2 < ndim(v_1) then ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : (if i = v_2 then shape(v_1, i) > 0)
>>
Rule 10 (for the unstacked negative axis, the mapped positive axis dimension size must be non-zero)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= if v_2 < 0 ∧ v_2 ≥ -1 * ndim(v_1) then ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : (if i = v_2 + ndim(v_1) then shape(v_1, i) > 0)
>>
Rule 11 (if axis is greater than 0 or less than -1, the tensor must have at least 2 dimensions)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= if v_2 > 0 ∨ v_2 < -1 then ndim(v_1) ≥ 2
>>
Rule 14 (unstack input tensor should not be empty in any of its dimensions)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0
>>
Rule 15 (input tensor must be at least 1-dimensional)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≠ 0
